WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.368 line:92%
-I want to say happy birthday.

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:02.869 size:78% position:39%
You recently had one.
-Your damn straight.

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:08.174 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm now 12 years old.
-[ Laughing ]

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:08.775 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I'm a big boy!

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:12.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, 12 doesn't seem wrong
for how you celebrated.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:15.615
-No, not at all.
-You went to, what is it called?

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:16.750 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Pirate's Adventure?

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.319
-Pirate Adventure Dinner, yeah.
-Pirate Adventure --

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:20.153 line:92%
-No, Pirate Dinner Adventure.

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:23.223 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's across the parking lot
from Medieval Times.

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:25.658
-Gotcha.
-Also a favorite staple of mine.

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:26.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You have been
to Medieval Times?

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:29.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Been to Medieval Times
many times.

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:30.597 line:92%
-So you decided to switch it up,

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:31.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
and here you are
on your birthday.

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:32.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But don't worry --
I kept it on-brand.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:34.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There you go, so --
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:35.435 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-There I am.

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:37.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So what happens
at Pirate Adventure Dinner?

00:00:37.771 --> 00:00:40.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Dinnertime Adventure Time?
-Yeah.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's -- You eat dinner.
-Yeah, okay.

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:44.744 size:88% position:44%
-You watch some pirates.
There's more of a play.

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:46.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's more of, like,
a story going on.

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:48.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think,
but I couldn't hear anything.

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:50.250
It was like --
they're mic'd up and they're --

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Gibberish ]
It's like mumbling.

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:53.486 size:75% position:38% line:92%
You're like, "What?"

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:55.588 align:start size:94% position:6%
And at one point,
they're like, "Yo-ho-ho-ho!"

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:56.623 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you're like,
"Okay, we're singing,

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:57.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
we're singing, we're singing."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.991 --> 00:01:00.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there are these
brief moments of clarity.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.429 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, at one point,
someone had this jewel,

00:01:02.429 --> 00:01:03.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they're like,
"That's a cursed jewel,

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.800
and the monster's gonna come
get us if we have the jewel."

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.201 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, okay,
so you're following along.

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:09.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Okay,
there's a monster involved."

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:10.670 line:92%
And at one point they name it.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:13.940
And they go, "We gotta watch out
for the Loch Ness Monster."

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:16.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "Whoa. What?
Wait a minute.

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:19.913 align:start size:94% position:6%
The Loch Ness Monster
is the Lake Ness monster.

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:21.114 line:92%
So either we're worried about

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:24.617 size:84% position:42%
Nessie having jumped
the confines of land...

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:25.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:27.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...or for the past
hour and a half,

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:28.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
we've been in a lake
the whole time.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:29.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:33.593 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And we're following a story
of Scottish lake pirates.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.829 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:37.230 line:92%
And I was like, "Uh, I'm out."

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.866
I checked out for a minute,
and then, like, Nessie comes up

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:42.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
through the boat,
and I was like, "I'm back in."

00:01:42.469 --> 00:01:43.636 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:45.171 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Shiver me timbers.
I was wrong."

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:48.341
-Are you -- Is it safe to say
you were the only group there

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:51.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
that doesn't
also have children with you?

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:53.913 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That does make me sound
like a real creep.

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:54.848 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:57.884 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I like to watch
all the youthful enthusiasm

00:01:57.884 --> 00:01:59.385 size:81% position:41% line:92%
of the children there.

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:00.653 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:01.955 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Bless 'em.

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:03.957 line:92%
Beautiful, beautiful kids.

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:06.426 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:07.393 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Congratulations.

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:08.995 align:start size:94% position:6%
Another season
of "Silicon Valley."

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:10.597 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks, man.
-Very exciting.

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:11.865 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:15.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The show -- The show has done
such a nice job

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:18.004
of advancing
the plot every year, but you --

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:19.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's an HBO show,
and you actually --

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:22.642 size:84% position:42%
You have a destination
and ending of this show

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:25.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
that crosses over
with another HBO show.

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.179 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Yeah, well, I don't --

00:02:26.179 --> 00:02:27.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, I guess you have
to say "spoiler alert."

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:30.083 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, oh, 'cause you think
this might happen?

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:33.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I've been pitching this
every single day

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:36.389 line:92%
to both Alec Berg, Mike Judge,

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:39.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the creators
of "Game of Thrones,"

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:41.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
because what I think
should happen...

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:42.395 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:43.496 line:92%
...is I think, at one point,

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:47.200 align:start size:94% position:6%
the dweebs on "Silicon Valley"
should code their way

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.102 line:92%
to the center of the Internet.

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:51.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
First, they have to download
all the Pentiums

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:54.174 align:start size:94% position:6%
and increase
their gigabyte size.

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:55.675 line:92%
And then they have a portal

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:57.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
that goes into
the "Game of Thrones" world.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, hear me out.
Shut up.

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:01.381 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:04.450
And then we get warped in.
And then we just really --

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.486 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, at that point,
I've lost --

00:03:06.486 --> 00:03:10.557
I don't know what will happen,
because probably, realistically,

00:03:10.557 --> 00:03:13.526 align:start size:94% position:6%
this will be
like Little Fingers',

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:16.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, sex boy or something.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:18.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Gotcha.
-Like, in my mind,

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:20.667 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm a knight.
I'm like me and the Hound

00:03:20.667 --> 00:03:23.670
are like, "Yeah," back-to-back,
fighting the White Walkers.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we're, like,
high-fiving each other.

00:03:25.038 --> 00:03:28.775
And he's like, "King of North."
I'm like, "Me, too."

00:03:28.775 --> 00:03:29.409 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:34.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, realistically, I'm, like,
Poisoned Victim Number Two.

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:36.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:40.286
-I'm on the screen for like
one second, going, "Aah!"

00:03:40.286 --> 00:03:41.955 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And then I'm done.

00:03:41.955 --> 00:03:42.956 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-You know, I guess,

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:46.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
you don't have a lot of skills
to bring to Westeros.

00:03:46.459 --> 00:03:48.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I was very surprised
to hear this,

00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:50.029 size:88% position:44%
that, back in the day,
when you were younger...

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:52.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-You took taekwondo classes.

00:03:52.332 --> 00:03:53.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Scattered cheers ]
-Heck, I did.

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:54.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Me and that guy.
-"Me and that guy."

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:58.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Taekwondo!
The forgotten art!

00:03:58.605 --> 00:04:00.807 line:92%
-How long did you stick with it?

00:04:00.807 --> 00:04:02.475 line:92%
Was this a lifelong endeavor?

00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:04.577 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-No, it was not at all.

00:04:04.577 --> 00:04:06.079 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I got -- I was --

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:07.447 line:92%
Man, I got to yellow belt.

00:04:07.447 --> 00:04:09.349 size:84% position:42%
But in order to get --
-That's the first belt.

00:04:09.349 --> 00:04:11.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's --
That's the third belt.

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:12.819 size:81% position:41%
-What comes before it?
-It's the second belt.

00:04:12.819 --> 00:04:14.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
But in taekwondo,
you get, like, white belt,

00:04:14.988 --> 00:04:16.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then white belt,
yellow stripe.

00:04:16.022 --> 00:04:17.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yep, yep.
-And then you might get, like,

00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:19.425
white belt, two yellow stripes.
I forget.

00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:20.293 line:92%
But it was always a challenge.

00:04:20.293 --> 00:04:24.030
Like, even the beginning, you --
you start out kind of like --

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's a lot
of kicking in taekwondo,

00:04:25.465 --> 00:04:26.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
and so there would be
a lot of drills,

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:28.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
so you'd take these blue mats,
like the blue gym mats,

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:29.702 line:92%
and just, like, kick them.

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:32.138
And all the guys are like --
all of the kids who, like,

00:04:32.138 --> 00:04:33.740 align:start size:94% position:6%
were really tough,
were just like, "Kyah!"

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:35.508 size:81% position:41%
like, whaling on them,
and I'm like, "Okay.

00:04:35.508 --> 00:04:36.909 align:start size:94% position:6%
I guess you really
got to go for it."

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:39.979 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'd hit it,
and my foot would hurt.

00:04:39.979 --> 00:04:40.847 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:40.847 --> 00:04:44.817 size:81% position:41% line:92%
The pads hurt my feet.

00:04:44.817 --> 00:04:48.921 size:81% position:41%
So I'd be like, "Kyah!
Oh, man! This sucks!"

00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:51.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
I like the form exercises,
which if you --

00:04:51.357 --> 00:04:52.992
I don't know if anybody's
taken any martial arts.

00:04:52.992 --> 00:04:55.395
Usually a lot of them have forms
where you're just like,

00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:57.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hyah! Hyah! Hyah!"
-Yeah.

00:04:57.797 --> 00:04:59.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, off by yourself,
kind of practicing.

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:02.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
Loved that.
Love the solo one.

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:03.169 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:03.169 --> 00:05:07.340 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then it's like --
"I like the performance part."

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.942 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:09.942 --> 00:05:11.678 size:88% position:44% line:92%
"Just me and the stage."

00:05:11.678 --> 00:05:13.012 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:13.012 --> 00:05:15.782 line:92%
Yeah, yeah, yeah, all right.

00:05:15.782 --> 00:05:18.117 line:92%
And then, why I -- why I quit

00:05:18.117 --> 00:05:20.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
is because I finally
got a yellow belt, right?

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, I remember
getting to the gym.

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:24.223 size:84% position:42%
We upgraded from, like,
the basement cafeteria

00:05:24.223 --> 00:05:25.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the gym
when you got to yellow belt.

00:05:25.725 --> 00:05:27.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"Okay, cool, more space.

00:05:27.894 --> 00:05:29.195 size:88% position:44% line:92%
More space to practice."

00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:31.931 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I immediately saw,
like, a huddle of boys,

00:05:31.931 --> 00:05:34.334 size:78% position:39%
and there were, like,
two boys fighting,

00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:35.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was like,
"Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:05:35.635 --> 00:05:37.103 align:start size:94% position:6%
What's --
What's this all about?"

00:05:37.103 --> 00:05:38.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they're like,
"Oh, at yellow belt,

00:05:38.271 --> 00:05:40.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
you start sparring.
This is when it gets good."

00:05:40.873 --> 00:05:41.974 line:92%
And I was like, "Oh, no."

00:05:41.974 --> 00:05:44.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I turned around
and called my mom

00:05:44.177 --> 00:05:47.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
and got her to pick me up.
And that was it.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And was your mom
fine with that?

00:05:48.815 --> 00:05:49.949 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Did she embrace it?

00:05:49.949 --> 00:05:51.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah!
-Yeah.

00:05:51.484 --> 00:05:52.919 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:52.919 --> 00:05:57.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Look at us! Just a --
Just a stage full of pussies.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:59.392 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:59.392 --> 00:06:01.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You quit, too?!
Me, too!"

00:06:01.961 --> 00:06:02.729 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:02.729 --> 00:06:05.665 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I'm glad it didn't --
You know, ultimately,

00:06:05.665 --> 00:06:08.201
I'm glad you didn't go down
the professional taekwondo path,

00:06:08.201 --> 00:06:10.236
because we're very lucky
to have you as a performer.

00:06:10.236 --> 00:06:13.740
-Yeah, well, you know, maybe
I would've done the crossover.

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:14.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-You know, like,

00:06:14.507 --> 00:06:17.643
I would've done, I don't know,
the John Cena, Rowdy Roddy --

00:06:17.643 --> 00:06:19.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
Rowdy Roddy Piper.
-It's not too late.

00:06:19.846 --> 00:06:21.781 size:81% position:41%
-Yeah, you're right.
I'll do the other way.

00:06:21.781 --> 00:06:24.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
Weird.
"Middleditch joins WWE.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
Why?"
[ Laughter ]

00:06:26.452 --> 00:06:29.722 line:92%
His alter-ego is taekwondo guy,

00:06:29.722 --> 00:06:31.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
Mr. Yellow Belt!
[ Laughter ]

00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:33.092 size:78% position:39%
-It's always so great
to see you, buddy.

00:06:33.092 --> 00:06:35.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks!
-Thank you for stopping by.

